    <p class="dc-endnote" id="dcEndnote">The inputs are linear; the outcome is not &mdash; that gap is the whole point, so the value axis is linear, not logarithmic. Computed from the site's <code>PL_DATA</code> price series (about 12-day samples, interpolated to a daily price in log space), so figures are close to, but not identical to, true daily closes. The habit auto-updates with each monthly price refresh.</p>
